        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Diane Warren, Beyoncé, Esperanza Spalding, Destinee & Paris\n- Songs: \"I Was Here\"\n- Albums: Loud\n- Awards: Grammy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Diane Warren wrote the song \"I Was Here\" and is also a producer.\n- Diane Warren won his fourth Grammy Award for a song performed by jazz singer Esperanza Spalding.\n- The song performed by Esperanza Spalding was from the album Loud.\n- Destinee & Paris cited Beyoncé as an influence.",
